{"function": "Apology for forgetting", "situation": "You forgot to bring something your friend asked for.", "cue": "Apologize for forgetting to bring something.", "text": "ごめん、忘れちゃった。", "english": "Sorry, I forgot.", "speaker": "either"}
]}

